          "200": {
            "description": "Read one company profile by returned slug: description, website, logo, source employee count and industries. Headcount is a public source observation; founding year omitted because source metadata is unreliable.\n\nThe response contains the tool result directly.\n\n| Documented field | Provider type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `description` | string |  |\n| `employee_count` | number |  |\n| `industries` | string[] |  |\n| `logo_url` | string |  |\n| `name` | string |  |\n| `observed_at_ms` | number |  |\n| `slug` | string |  |\n| `source_url` | string |  |\n| `website` | string |  |\n\n\nThese are the provider's documented fields. Field requiredness, nullability and nested object structures are specified only where the descriptions explicitly say so.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "not": {
